<title>USA: Cupertino USD, Calif.,won by BancAmerica Sec.</title>
<headline>Cupertino USD, Calif.,won by BancAmerica Sec.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica Securities said it won $18.250 million of Cupertino USD, Calif., 1997 general obligation bonds, Election of 1995, Series B, with a true interest cost of 5.65 percent.</p>
</text>
